 dependent studios whose game already has an early-stage prototype and need
 s funding to reach a significant development milestone: completion or rele
 ase\, Early Access\, a demo\, a vertical slice or an accolade-ready protot
 ype.\n\nOrganisation: Screen Australia\nLocation: Australia. Incorporated 
 companies carrying on business in Australia with central management and co
 ntrol in Australia\; sole traders\, trusts and public companies are not el
 igible.\nAward: Up to AUD 100\,000 per project. No application fee.\nDurat
 ion: Takes an original Australian independent game with an existing early 
